    <h1 id="versionHeadLine" class="headline ">
        
Elections
    </h1>





<div id="cpuiRenderRoot"><div id="cc1594fee8-b6b1-4034-a4dc-576088b6b300" data-containerid="1594fee8-b6b1-4034-a4dc-576088b6b300" class="pageContent cpGrid cpGrid24 showInMobile"><div class="row outer wide"><div class="outer col col24 first" data-widgetcontainerid="035659ca-3898-43d4-a1ba-d2c01ee5345e"><div class="row nest first wide"><div class="inner col col24 first last id3dbee59f-0787-4bcc-b759-5c9c0d533246" data-widgetcontainerid="3dbee59f-0787-4bcc-b759-5c9c0d533246"><div class="universal target center" data-widget-id="2902f718-2234-42c5-945f-8a034b79d7a2"></div><span id="indicator_2902f718-2234-42c5-945f-8a034b79d7a2_0" class="indicator universal"><span></span></span><div id="2902f718-2234-42c5-945f-8a034b79d7a2" class="widget-wrapper"><div><div id="widget2902f718-2234-42c5-945f-8a034b79d7a2" class="wide widget widgetUniversal skin125 cp-format--stacked "><div class="widgetBody cpGrid cpGrid1 undefined"><div class="row wide"><div data-column-index="1" class="col col1 first last"><div class="content-item-collection semanticList"><div data-id="33bf660c-46ef-47d2-9cc2-aa2a7d07aff4" class="content-item--33bf660c-46ef-47d2-9cc2-aa2a7d07aff4 content-item pageStyles"><div class="content-item--outer-wrap"><div draggable="false" class="content-item--inner-wrap"><div data-id="33bf660c-46ef-47d2-9cc2-aa2a7d07aff4" data-testid="contentItem" class="widgetItem widgetItem--contentItem  "><div class="widgetText"><h2 class="widgetTitle"><a id="content-item-title-2902f718-2234-42c5-945f-8a034b79d7a2-33bf660c-46ef-47d2-9cc2-aa2a7d07aff4" href="?contentId=33bf660c-46ef-47d2-9cc2-aa2a7d07aff4" class="cp-cursor--pointer widgetTitle--link" rel="noreferrer" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></a></h2><div class="widgetMeta contentItem-secondary"></div><div class="widgetDesc"><div class="cp-fieldWrapper fr-view"><h2 data-pasted="true">Make a plan to vote at pima.vote</h2><p>Visit <a href="http://www.pima.vote" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">pima.vote</a>, Pima County&rsquo;s hub for election and voting information, combining resources from the Elections Department and the Recorder&rsquo;s Office. Find important dates and deadlines, registration information, voting options and more. Explore the <a href="https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/21445fb10f884caea0aac1ecba764599/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">interactive map</a> to find the most convenient Vote Centers, early voting sites and ballot drop-off locations.</p><p>Voters who are unable to leave their vehicles can vote curbside at <a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/b18fecdf-2291-407f-9fbc-9551c7e06719" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" rel="noopener noreferrer">21 Pima County Vote Centers (PDF)</a> on Election Day, Nov. 3.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row outer wide"><div class="outer col col24 first" data-widgetcontainerid="9c6c578b-502c-407c-9654-e4d74451689f"><div class="row nest first wide"><div class="inner col col24 first last idbc4f0ff7-5385-4bba-a97d-5b7df89c9001" data-widgetcontainerid="bc4f0ff7-5385-4bba-a97d-5b7df89c9001"><div class="universal target center" data-widget-id="6e2c57e4-c353-4baa-bea3-6db509ac90a6"></div><span id="indicator_6e2c57e4-c353-4baa-bea3-6db509ac90a6_0" class="indicator universal"><span></span></span><div id="6e2c57e4-c353-4baa-bea3-6db509ac90a6" class="widget-wrapper"><div><div id="widget6e2c57e4-c353-4baa-bea3-6db509ac90a6" class="wide widget widgetUniversal skin43 cp-format--stacked "><div class="widgetBody cpGrid cpGrid1 undefined"><div class="row wide"><div data-column-index="1" class="col col1 first last"><div class="content-item-collection semanticList"><div data-id="ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7" class="content-item--ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7 content-item pageStyles"><div class="content-item--outer-wrap"><div draggable="false" class="content-item--inner-wrap"><div data-id="ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7" data-testid="contentItem" class="widgetItem widgetItem--contentItem  "><div class="widgetText"><h2 class="widgetTitle"><a id="content-item-title-6e2c57e4-c353-4baa-bea3-6db509ac90a6-ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7" href="?contentId=ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7" class="cp-cursor--pointer widgetTitle--link" rel="noreferrer" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></a></h2><div class="widgetMeta contentItem-secondary"></div><div class="widgetDesc"><div class="cp-fieldWrapper fr-view"><h2>Pima County Elections Department</h2><p>Welcome to the Pima County Elections Department. Our mission is to ensure the accessibility, accuracy, and integrity of the electoral process by providing greater transparency to our constituents, candidates, and stakeholders while maintaining the safety and security of the election and our staff. Under the direction of the Board of Supervisors and County Administration, the Elections Department works closely with the Recorder&#39;s Office to administer and coordinate all elections in accordance with Arizona Revised Statutes.</p><p>Your go-to resource for all things related to upcoming elections. Here, you&rsquo;ll find essential information about candidates, key issues, and voting procedures to help you make informed decisions.</p><p>Join us in empowering your community through knowledge and participation. Together, let&rsquo;s make every vote count!</p><h2 data-pasted="true">Public Records Requests&nbsp;</h2><p>The public may submit public records requests for Elections Department records by submitting a request through the Pima County Clerk of the Board&#39;s <a href="https://pimacountyaz.mycusthelp.com/WEBAPP/_rs/(S(0v5fzykjy3ffmk0ae2max4fq))/supporthome.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">online request portal.</a>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><h2>2026 Election and Voter Information</h2></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row outer wide"><div class="outer col col24 first" data-widgetcontainerid="a195ef52-3a27-4655-ac4e-f5450fdc1680"><div class="row nest first wide"><div class="inner col col24 first last idc89923e7-ef58-47c6-8513-5515e97f6a27" data-widgetcontainerid="c89923e7-ef58-47c6-8513-5515e97f6a27"><div class="universal target center" data-widget-id="54be6377-a355-45a9-8d2a-f86774f036af"></div><span id="indicator_54be6377-a355-45a9-8d2a-f86774f036af_0" class="indicator universal"><span></span></span><div id="54be6377-a355-45a9-8d2a-f86774f036af" class="widget-wrapper"><div><div id="widget54be6377-a355-45a9-8d2a-f86774f036af" class="wide widget widgetUniversal skin43 cp-format--stacked "><div class="widgetBody cpGrid cpGrid1 undefined"><div class="row wide"><div data-column-index="1" class="col col1 first last"><div class="content-item-collection semanticList"><div data-id="586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d" class="content-item--586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d content-item pageStyles"><div class="content-item--outer-wrap"><div draggable="false" class="content-item--inner-wrap"><div data-id="586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d" data-testid="contentItem" class="widgetItem widgetItem--contentItem  "><div class="widgetText"><h2 class="widgetTitle"><a id="content-item-title-54be6377-a355-45a9-8d2a-f86774f036af-586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d" href="?contentId=586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d" class="cp-cursor--pointer widgetTitle--link" rel="noreferrer" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></a></h2><div class="widgetMeta contentItem-secondary"></div><div class="widgetDesc"><div class="cp-fieldWrapper fr-view"><div class="pc-container-flex pc-flex-30"><div class="pc-card"><div class="pc-card-top" style="padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;"><div class="pc-card-image"><a href="/2865/Election-Results"><img src="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/ce5cb84e-8be1-4107-9cad-c2e5ed8a0ecf" class="fr-fic fr-dii" alt=""> <span>Results &amp; Data</span></a></div><hr><p style="text-align: left !important;">Statewide voter registration statistics and election results.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style="text-align: left !important;"><br></p><p style="text-align: left !important;"><strong>General Election - Tuesday, November 3, 2026</strong></p><ul><li style="text-align: left !important;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/6f78d212-b285-45ec-8540-eb6921530b1e" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 General Election - Early Ballots Processed (PDF)</a></li></ul><p style="text-align: left !important;"><strong>&nbsp;Primary Election -<strong>Tuesday, July 21, 2026</strong></strong></p><ul><li style="text-align: left !important;"><a href="https://results.arizona.vote/#/featured/68/0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Statewide Results</a></li><li style="text-align: left !important;"><a href="https://www.livevoterturnout.com/ENR/pimaazenr/6/en/Index_6.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Pima County Results</a></li><li style="text-align: left !important;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/c93b54c7-da6a-41f7-9347-0d87a5ff28d8" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Primary Election - Summary Results (PDF)</a></li><li style="text-align: left;" data-pasted="true"><a href="https://www.pima.gov/asset/c6eaf02e-2e2d-40a4-8b4d-f0e0210a37bd" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" rel="noopener noreferrer">2026 Primary Election - Summary Results (CSV)</a></li><li style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/742a06fa-8f2a-45b7-8ec1-350db4493fc3" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Primary Election - Early Ballots Processed (PDF)</a></li><li style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/6f69c698-10e3-4603-a0f5-10c77da24f57" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Primary Election - Early Ballots Dropped off at Vote Centers (PDF)</a></li><li style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/ffd2c05d-b736-4c23-a173-dd431c27277f" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Primary Election - ID Verified Early Ballots (PDF)</a></li><li style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/e4426d47-de8c-4423-9e2d-2a9fcf2414ef" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Primary Election - ID Verified Early Ballots Processed (PDF)</a></li><li style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/94901e7e-0248-4c81-a232-b3a0101dc819" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Primary Election Provisional Ballots Processed (PDF)</a></li></ul><p><br></p></div><div class="pc-card-bottom"><div class="pc-button-standard"><a href="/2865/Election-Results"><div class="pc-graphic-button pc-data"><span>Historical Results &amp; Data</span></div></a></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><div class="pc-card-top"><div class="pc-card-image"><a href="/810/Current-Information"><img src="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/a17384b1-ca27-4b89-9096-9caf5c4d98fc" class="fr-fic fr-dii" alt=""> <span>Election Information</span></a></div><hr><p style="text-align: left !important;">Stay informed about the upcoming elections in 2026, including key dates and important voting information.</p><p style="text-align: left !important;"><br></p><ul style="text-align: left !important;"><li data-pasted="true"><a href="/810/Upcoming-Elections">2026 General Election Information and Events</a></li><li data-pasted="true"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/252304ac-65ea-4005-a24d-309149ed0464" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 General Election Vote Center Locations (Excel)</a></li><li data-pasted="true"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/128b8404-5fdd-411c-9ccb-946b250f8727" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 General Election Vote Center Locations by Region (PDF)</a></li><li data-pasted="true"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/db8111d5-55f3-4cfc-9745-b93ccf8eebb3" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="docaccess-activated" data-docaccess-source-url="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/db8111d5-55f3-4cfc-9745-b93ccf8eebb3" data-url-hash="dcfe7d46fca4832c244858c0707bc3909ecbb58cc31678f918cbe8f5445ce264" data-url-status="disabled" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Your Voice, Your Vote: Pima County Election Guide (PDF)</a> | <a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/57131098-55f6-4392-9fd2-b1046d6f7f58" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="docaccess-activated" data-docaccess-source-url="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/57131098-55f6-4392-9fd2-b1046d6f7f58" data-url-hash="ba783c27a09d904dd4149f8867fcc78a3973d162898735a2e3ba86158aae4e03" data-url-status="disabled" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Spanish (PDF)</a></li><li><a class="docaccess-activated" href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/12e25ab1-f0f3-44b0-ad6e-d3e83be56755" target="_blank">How Your Ballot is Tabulated (PDF)</a></li><li><a href="https://web1.pima.gov/elections/livefeed/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Live Ballot Counting Video Feed</a></li><li><a href="/665/Required-Identification-at-Polls">Required Identification at Polls</a></li><li><a href="/671/Informative-Links">Related Resources with links</a></li><li data-pasted="true"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/b6bd78d4-9b8d-4a69-a1a6-cc94ace3e630" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Primary Election Day Early Ballot Drop-Off Guide (PDF)</a></li><li data-pasted="true"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/bc32ca8d-ae7c-469f-a612-51ab1a83f14b" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Primary Election After-Action Report (PDF)</a></li></ul></div><div class="pc-card-bottom"><div class="pc-button-standard"><a href="/810/Current-Information"><div class="pc-graphic-button pc-info"><span>More Election Information</span></div></a></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><div class="pc-card-top" style="padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;"><div class="pc-card-image"><a href="/678/Candidate-PAC-Information-Packets"><img src="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/f21d9e81-b81f-4be3-b5e2-d1cda51a8b05" class="fr-fic fr-dii" alt=""> <span>Candidates</span></a></div><hr><p style="text-align: left !important;">Explore candidate filings for federal, state, and local offices.</p><p style="text-align: left !important;"><br></p><p style="text-align: left !important;" data-pasted="true"><strong>General Election - November 3, 2026</strong></p><ul><li data-pasted="true" style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/cff6dae0-1297-4a92-94db-c29661602fff" target="_blank" class="docaccess-activated" data-docaccess-source-url="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/cff6dae0-1297-4a92-94db-c29661602fff" data-url-hash="8e45ee4eb178a77cc66d4d495cd56127fc62f687e40b2637e3c78e72c233b660" data-url-status="new" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Statements of Interest Filed - General (PDF)</a></li><li data-pasted="true" style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/4e390a40-4306-4cb1-a524-83006e9f11d4" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 General Election Candidates Filed (PDF)</a></li><li data-pasted="true" style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/d2c310c3-ade7-484e-a6f0-1ddaebec0799" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 General Election Official Candidate List (PDF)</a></li><li data-pasted="true" style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/b54c9e42-8520-4201-be8d-10b859da80df" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 General Election Official Write-In List (PDF)</a></li></ul><p style="text-align: left !important;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p></div><div class="pc-card-bottom"><div class="pc-button-standard"><a href="/678/Candidates"><div class="pc-graphic-button pc-people"><span>More Candidate Information</span></div></a></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><div class="pc-card-top" style="padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;"><div class="pc-card-image"><a href="/667/Poll-Worker-Information"><img src="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/b64d4a2a-6806-44b3-a8fb-1bc3212fc957" class="fr-fic fr-dii" alt=""> <span>Get Involved - Be a Poll Worker</span></a></div><hr><p style="text-align: left !important;">Help your community and support democracy on Election Day! Poll workers receive training and a stipend.</p><p style="text-align: left !important;"><br></p><ul style="text-align: left !important;"><li><a href="https://pimacaz.precinctcentral.com/TED/ElectionForcePortal/JobApplication.aspx" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Poll Worker Application - Apply today!</a></li><li><a href="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/15249fa5-77ea-4a7a-aade-03954e8b88a5" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="docaccess-activated" data-docaccess-source-url="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/15249fa5-77ea-4a7a-aade-03954e8b88a5" data-url-hash="7c09550814e47678ef3118c437ce25fadb5b6833c9313c7449943ebbb7508fc7" data-url-status="disabled" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Poll Worker Handbook (PDF)</a></li><li><a href="https://pimacaz.precinctcentral.com/TED/ElectionForcePortal/Landing.aspx" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Poll Worker Portal</a></li><li><a href="/667/Poll-Worker-Information">Poll Worker Qualifications</a></li></ul></div><div class="pc-card-bottom"><div class="pc-button-standard"><a href="/667/Poll-Worker-Information"><div class="pc-graphic-button pc-task-worker"><span>More Poll Worker Information</span></div></a></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><div class="pc-card-top" style="padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;"><div class="pc-card-image"><a href="/620/Campaign-Finance"><img src="https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/76c1f3b8-0d4a-486b-860a-6a31ed378045" class="fr-fic fr-dii" alt=""><span>Campaign Finance</span></a></div><hr><p style="text-align: left !important;">Transparency in campaign finance helps you make informed choices. For more details view specific financial reports at the links provided below.</p><ul style="text-align: left !important;"><li><a href="http://pimacountyaz.easyvotecampaignfinance.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" id="isPasted" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Search Campaign Finance Records</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pima.gov/asset/89bf1f3b-cc98-4c83-93ac-0ecb3638ae42" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2025-2026 Campaign Finance Report (Fillable PDF)</a></li><li><a href="https://www.azleg.gov/arsDetail/?title=16" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Arizona Revised Statutes, Title 16</a></li><li><a href="https://www.pima.gov/620/Campaign-Finance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">More information for new and established committees</a></li></ul><div class="pc-card-bottom"><div class="pc-button-standard"><a href="/620/Campaign-Finance"><div class="pc-graphic-button pc-audit"><span>More Campaign Finance</span></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row outer wide"><div class="outer col col24 first" data-widgetcontainerid="37428a37-7a42-4f5c-b23f-925da173a42b"><div class="row nest first wide"><div class="inner col col24 first last idfa1e33b2-e473-494b-b7b6-1fdee6b681b7" data-widgetcontainerid="fa1e33b2-e473-494b-b7b6-1fdee6b681b7"><div class="universal target center" data-widget-id="2b468b43-68ab-41b2-bf22-95b4cfe8aeac"></div><span id="indicator_2b468b43-68ab-41b2-bf22-95b4cfe8aeac_0" class="indicator universal"><span></span></span><div id="2b468b43-68ab-41b2-bf22-95b4cfe8aeac" class="widget-wrapper"><div><div id="widget2b468b43-68ab-41b2-bf22-95b4cfe8aeac" class="wide widget widgetUniversal skin64 cp-format--stacked "><div class="widgetHeader"><h2 class="widgetHeader--text h2"><a class="widgetHeader--link" href="/394?viewAll=2b468b43-68ab-41b2-bf22-95b4cfe8aeac" rel="noreferrer">Election News</a></h2></div><div class="widgetBody cpGrid cpGrid2 undefined"><div class="row wide"><div data-column-index="1" class="col col1 first "><div class="content-item-collection semanticList"><div data-id="ea0debae-26d6-42e8-a06f-03f31662303e" class="content-item--ea0debae-26d6-42e8-a06f-03f31662303e content-item pageStyles"><div class="content-item--outer-wrap"><div draggable="false" class="content-item--inner-wrap"><div data-id="ea0debae-26d6-42e8-a06f-03f31662303e" data-testid="contentItem" class="widgetItem widgetItem--contentItem  cp-clearfix"><div class="cp-format-media cp