505px"/></div></div><div class="widgetText"><h3 id="content-item-title-2b468b43-68ab-41b2-bf22-95b4cfe8aeac-ea0debae-26d6-42e8-a06f-03f31662303e" class="widgetTitle"><div class="cp-fieldWrapper">Your guide to Election Day in Pima County: Voting, ballot drop-off and results</div></h3><div class="widgetMeta contentItem-secondary"><div class="cp-fieldWrapper">Fri, Oct 30, 2026</div></div><div class="widgetDesc">The 2026 General Election is Tuesday, Nov. 3, and Pima County has resources to help voters find a Vote Center, return an early ballot and follow...</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-column-index="2" class="col col1  last"><div class="content-item-collection semanticList"><div data-id="b34a4273-40c7-4b1f-9969-018fb5e7bdc9" class="content-item--b34a4273-40c7-4b1f-9969-018fb5e7bdc9 content-item pageStyles"><div class="content-item--outer-wrap"><div draggable="false" class="content-item--inner-wrap"><div data-id="b34a4273-40c7-4b1f-9969-018fb5e7bdc9" data-testid="contentItem" class="widgetItem widgetItem--contentItem  "><div class="widgetText"><h3 id="content-item-title-2b468b43-68ab-41b2-bf22-95b4cfe8aeac-b34a4273-40c7-4b1f-9969-018fb5e7bdc9" class="widgetTitle"><div class="cp-fieldWrapper">Federal observers to monitor Pima County General Election</div></h3><div class="widgetMeta contentItem-secondary"><div class="cp-fieldWrapper">Thu, Oct 29, 2026</div></div><div class="widgetDesc">Pima County will have Department of Justice observers &amp;ndash; typically referred to as monitors &amp;ndash; during the Nov. 3 General Election,...</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><a href="/394?viewAll=2b468b43-68ab-41b2-bf22-95b4cfe8aeac" rel="noreferrer" class="widgetViewAll alignRight cp-Btn--nonStyled" aria-label="View All Election News">View All News</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row outer wide"><div class="outer col col24 first" data-widgetcontainerid="0a1773f4-aba8-4731-a016-a916b4bbfc18"><div class="