om/api/assets/az-pimacounty/bc32ca8d-ae7c-469f-a612-51ab1a83f14b\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2026 Primary Election After-Action Report (PDF)<\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card-bottom\\"><div class=\\"pc-button-standard\\"><a href=\\"/810/Current-Information\\"><div class=\\"pc-graphic-button pc-info\\"><span>More Election Information<\/span><\/div><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-top\\" style=\\"padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-image\\"><a href=\\"/678/Candidate-PAC-Information-Packets\\"><img src=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/f21d9e81-b81f-4be3-b5e2-d1cda51a8b05\\" class=\\"fr-fic fr-dii\\" alt=\\"\\"> <span>Candidates<\/span><\/a><\/div><hr><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\">Explore candidate filings for federal, state, and local offices.<\/p><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><br><\/p><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\" data-pasted=\\"true\\"><strong>General Election - November 3, 2026<\/strong><\/p><ul><li data-pasted=\\"true\\" style=\\"text-align: left;\\"><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/cff6dae0-1297-4a92-94db-c29661602fff\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"docaccess-activated\\" data-docaccess-source-url=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/cff6dae0-1297-4a92-94db-c29661602fff\\" data-url-hash=\\"8e45ee4eb178a77cc66d4d495cd56127fc62f687e40b2637e3c78e72c233b660\\" data-url-status=\\"new\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2026 Statements of Interest Filed - General (PDF)<\/a><\/li><li data-pasted=\\"true\\" style=\\"text-align: left;\\"><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/4e390a40-4306-4cb1-a524-83006e9f11d4\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2026 General Election Candidates Filed (PDF)<\/a><\/li><li data-pasted=\\"true\\" style=\\"text-align: left;\\"><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/d2c310c3-ade7-484e-a6f0-1ddaebec0799\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2026 General Election Official Candidate List (PDF)<\/a><\/li><li data-pasted=\\"true\\" style=\\"text-align: left;\\"><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/b54c9e42-8520-4201-be8d-10b859da80df\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2026 General Election Official Write-In List (PDF)<\/a><\/li><\/ul><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card-bottom\\"><div class=\\"pc-button-standard\\"><a href=\\"/678/Candidates\\"><div class=\\"pc-graphic-button pc-people\\"><span>More Candidate Information<\/span><\/div><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-top\\" style=\\"padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-image\\"><a href=\\"/667/Poll-Worker-Information\\"><img src=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/b64d4a2a-6806-44b3-a8fb-1bc3212fc957\\" class=\\"fr-fic fr-dii\\" alt=\\"\\"> <span>Get Involved - Be a Poll Worker<\/span><\/a><\/div><hr><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\">Help your community and support democracy on Election Day! Poll workers receive training and a stipend.<\/p><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><br><\/p><ul style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><li><a href=\\"https://pimacaz.precinctcentral.com/TED/ElectionForcePortal/JobApplication.aspx\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Poll Worker Application - Apply today!<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/15249fa5-77ea-4a7a-aade-03954e8b88a5\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"docaccess-activated\\" data-docaccess-source-url=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/15249fa5-77ea-4a7a-aade-03954e8b88a5\\" data-url-hash=\\"7c09550814e47678ef3118c437ce25fadb5b6833c9313c7449943ebbb7508fc7\\" data-url-status=\\"disabled\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Poll Worker Handbook (PDF)<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://pimacaz.precinctcentral.com/TED/ElectionForcePortal/Landing.aspx\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Poll Worker Portal<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"/667/Poll-Worker-Information\\">Poll Worker Qualifications<\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card-bottom\\"><div class=\\"pc-button-standard\\"><a href=\\"/667/Poll-Worker-Information\\"><div class=\\"pc-graphic-button pc-task-worker\\"><span>More Poll Worker Information<\/span><\/div><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-top\\" style=\\"padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-image\\"><a href=\\"/620/Campaign-Finance\\"><img src=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/76c1f3b8-0d4a-486b-860a-6a31ed378045\\" class=\\"fr-fic fr-dii\\" alt=\\"\\"><span>Campaign Finance<\/span><\/a><\/div><hr><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\">Transparency in campaign finance helps you make informed choices. For more details view specific financial reports at the links provided below.<\/p><ul style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><li><a href=\\"http://pimacountyaz.easyvotecampaignfinance.com\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" id=\\"isPasted\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Search Campaign Finance Records<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://www.pima.gov/asset/89bf1f3b-cc98-4c83-93ac-0ecb3638ae42\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2025-2026 Campaign Finance Report (Fillable PDF)<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://www.azleg.gov/arsDetail/?title=16\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Arizona Revised Statutes, Title 16<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://www.pima.gov/620/Campaign-Finance\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\">More information for new and established committees<\/a><\/li><\/ul><div class=\\"pc-card-bottom\\"><div class=\\"pc-button-standard\\"><a href=\\"/620/Campaign-Finance\\"><div class=\\"pc-graphic-button pc-audit\\"><span>More Campaign Finance<\/span><\/div><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>"}},"created":"2024-10-15T18:07:39Z","lastModified":"2026-10-14T00:28:51Z","status":"UNIVERSAL > LOADING_COMPLETE","statusColor":"#4caf50","contentTypeName":"article","contentTypeDisplayName":"Article","version":187,"contentTypeId":"b3d073e4-61c9-4ef8-bd47-543a8c94e32f,article","tagsDeleted":[],"tags":["Election Cards"],"categories":[{"id":"ea233dff-a4bf-4071-ab68-20fdf6e902ea","name":"Elections"}],"permissionSet":{"id":"4ac01e07-8768-4ad2-bd2a-be9c79c06539","name":"Elections","version":0,"lastModified":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","_links":{}},"notificationDetails":{"subject":"A modification to a Article has been made!","smsMessage":"A modification to a Article has been made!"},"isEncrypted":false,"emailAddresses":[],"_links":{"self":{"href":"/api/content/az-pimacounty/article/586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d","method":"GET"},"previous":{"href":"/api/content/az-pimacounty/article/586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d/186","method":"GET"}},"templatedData":{"STACKED":{"title":null,"secondary":null,"thumbnail":null,"seeMore":"","contentType":"Article","id":"586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d","lastModified":"","meta":{"586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d":{"contentType":"article","isAsset":false,"isImage":false,"options":{}}},"newStatus":"","newStatusColor":"","scheduledJob":{},"status":"","statusColor":"","scheduleJob":{},"titleText":"","bodyText":"Results & Data\\n\\nStatewide voter registration statistics and election results. \\n\\nGeneral Election - Tuesday, November 3, 2026\\n\\n* 2026 General Election - Early Ballots Processed (PDF)\\n\\n Primary Election -Tuesday, July 21, 2026\\n\\n* Statewide Results\\n* Pima County Results\\n* 2026 Primary Election - Summary Results (PDF)\\n* 2026 Primary Election - Summary Results (CSV)\\n* 2026 Primary Election - Early Ballots Processed (PDF)\\n* 2026 Primary Election - Early Ballots Dropped off at Vote Centers (PDF)\\n* 2026 Primary Election - ID Verified Early Ballots (PDF)\\n* 2026 Primary Election - ID Verified Early Ballots Processed (PDF)\\n* 2026 Primary Election Provisional Ballots Processed (PDF)\\n\\nHistorical Results & Data\\n\\nElection Information\\n\\nStay informed about the upcoming elections in 2026, including key dates and important voting information.\\n\\n* 2026 General Election Information and Events\\n* 2026 General Election Vote Center Locations (Excel)\\n* 2026 General Election Vote Center Locations by Region (PDF)\\n* Your Voice, Your Vote: Pima County Election Guide (PDF) | Spanish (PDF)\\n* How Your Ballot is Tabulated (PDF)\\n* Live Ballot Counting Video Feed\\n* Required Identification at Polls\\n* Related Resources with links\\n* 2026 Primary Election Day Early Ballot Drop-Off Guide (PDF)\\n* 2026 Primary Election After-Action Report (PDF)\\n\\nMore Election Information\\n\\nCandidates\\n\\nExplore candidate filings for federal, state, and local offices.\\n\\nGeneral Election - November 3, 2026\\n\\n* 2026 Statements of Interest Filed - General (PDF)\\n* 2026 General Election Candidates Filed (PDF)\\n* 2026 General Election Official Candidate List (PDF)\\n* 2026 General Election Official Write-In List (PDF)\\n\\n                                                                                          \\n\\nMore Candidate Information\\n\\nGet Involved - Be a Poll Worker\\n\\nHelp your community and support democracy on Election Day! Poll workers receive training and a stipend.\\n\\n* Poll Worker Application - Apply today!\\n* Poll Worker Handbook (PDF)\\n* Poll Worker Portal\\n* Poll Worker Qualifications\\n\\nMore Poll Worker Information\\n\\nCampaign Finance\\n\\nTransparency in campaign finance helps you make informed choices. For more details view specific financial reports at the links provided below.\\n\\n* Search Campaign Finance Records\\n* 2025-2026 Campaign Finance Report (Fillable PDF)\\n* Arizona Revised Statutes, Title 16\\n* More information for new and established committees\\n\\nMore Campaign Finance"}}}},"options":{"autoPopulate":false,"optionSetId":1,"autoAdjust":true,"removePastDates":true,"hidePlaceholders":false,"skinId":43,"widgetFormat":"STACKED","presetId":"STACKED_PRESET","viewAllRadioOption":"default","selectedSortDisplayName":"Most Relevant","includedAssetTypes":{"images":false,"pdfs":true,"otherFiles":false}},"itemsUnableToRender":[],"formatConfigurations":{},"status":"UNIVERSAL > LOADING","columns":[["586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d"]],"autoPopulatedContentItems":[],"manualContentItemIds":["586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d"],"manualContentItemsOptions":{"586b5800-73a9-4035-92be-7f4d737e3b6d":{"contentType":"article","isAsset":false,"isImage":false,"options":{}}},"filterOptions":{}},"6e2c57e4-c353-4baa-bea3-6db509ac90a6":{"isInitialized":true,"widgetId":"6e2c57e4-c353-4baa-bea3-6db509ac90a6","contentItems":{"ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7":{"contentItemId":"ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7","isLoading":false,"isPlaceholderItem":false,"contentType":"article","id":"ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7","slug":"elections-mockup","createdBy":"subject:af31c080-e877-4679-a806-b9ec4e1e03bd","lastModifiedBy":"subject:4cd862b5-5582-48be-a5bb-5fd99fb6400f","data":{"name":{"en":"Elections (mockup)"},"article":{"en":"<h2>Pima County Elections Department<\/h2><p>Welcome to the Pima County Elections Department. Our mission is to ensure the accessibility, accuracy, and integrity of the electoral process by providing greater transparency to our constituents, candidates, and stakeholders while maintaining the safety and security of the election and our staff. Under the direction of the Board of Supervisors and County Administration, the Elections Department works closely with the Recorder&#39;s Office to administer and coordinate all elections in accordance with Arizona Revised Statutes.<\/p><p>Your go-to resource for all things related to upcoming elections. Here, you&rsquo;ll find essential information about candidates, key issues, and voting procedures to help you make informed decisions.<\/p><p>Join us in empowering your community through knowledge and participation. Together, let&rsquo;s make every vote count!<\/p><h2 data-pasted=\\"true\\">Public Records Requests&nbsp;<\/h2><p>The public may submit public records requests for Elections Department records by submitting a request through the Pima County Clerk of the Board&#39;s <a href=\\"https://pimacountyaz.mycusthelp.com/WEBAPP/_rs/(S(0v5fzykjy3ffmk0ae2max4fq))/supporthome.aspx\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">online request portal.<\/a>&nbsp;<\/p><p><br><\/p><h2>2026 Election and Voter Information<\/h2>"}},"titles":{"name":{"en":"Elections (mockup)"}},"searchFields":{"article":{"en":"<h2>Pima County Elections Department<\/h2><p>Welcome to the Pima County Elections Department. Our mission is to ensure the accessibility, accuracy, and integrity of the electoral process by providing greater transparency to our constituents, candidates, and stakeholders while maintaining the safety and security of the election and our staff. Under the direction of the Board of Supervisors and County Administration, the Elections Department works closely with the Recorder&#39;s Office to administer and coordinate all elections in accordance with Arizona Revised Statutes.<\/p><p>Your go-to resource for all things related to upcoming elections. Here, you&rsquo;ll find essential information about candidates, key issues, and voting procedures to help you make informed decisions.<\/p><p>Join us in empowering your community through knowledge and participation. Together, let&rsquo;s make every vote count!<\/p><h2 data-pasted=\\"true\\">Public Records Requests&nbsp;<\/h2><p>The public may submit public records requests for Elections Department records by submitting a request through the Pima County Clerk of the Board&#39;s <a href=\\"https://pimacountyaz.mycusthelp.com/WEBAPP/_rs/(S(0v5fzykjy3ffmk0ae2max4fq))/supporthome.aspx\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">online request portal.<\/a>&nbsp;<\/p><p><br><\/p><h2>2026 Election and Voter Information<\/h2>"}},"created":"2024-10-15T18:01:57Z","lastModified":"2026-10-26T16:36:09Z","status":"UNIVERSAL > LOADING_COMPLETE","statusColor":"#4caf50","contentTypeName":"article","contentTypeDisplayName":"Article","version":9,"contentTypeId":"b3d073e4-61c9-4ef8-bd47-543a8c94e32f,article","tagsDeleted":[],"tags":[],"categories":[{"id":"ea233dff-a4bf-4071-ab68-20fdf6e902ea","name":"Elections"}],"permissionSet":{"id":"06f7b6d6-092b-4bee-8b9a-c3e45a10aeda","name":"Article","version":0,"lastModified":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","_links":{}},"notificationDetails":{"subject":"A modification to a Article has been made!","smsMessage":"A modification to a Article has been made!"},"isEncrypted":false,"emailAddresses":[],"_links":{"self":{"href":"/api/content/az-pimacounty/article/ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7","method":"GET"},"previous":{"href":"/api/content/az-pimacounty/article/ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7/8","method":"GET"}},"templatedData":{"STACKED":{"title":null,"secondary":null,"thumbnail":null,"seeMore":"","contentType":"Article","id":"ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7","lastModified":"","meta":{"ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7":{"contentType":"article","isAsset":false,"isImage":false,"options":{}}},"newStatus":"","newStatusColor":"","scheduledJob":{},"status":"","statusColor":"","scheduleJob":{},"titleText":"","bodyText":"PIMA COUNTY ELECTIONS DEPARTMENT\\n\\nWelcome to the Pima County Elections Department. Our mission is to ensure the accessibility, accuracy, and integrity of the electoral process by providing greater transparency to our constituents, candidates, and stakeholders while maintaining the safety and security of the election and our staff. Under the direction of the Board of Supervisors and County Administration, the Elections Department works closely with the Recorder&#39;s Office to administer and coordinate all elections in accordance with Arizona Revised Statutes.\\n\\nYour go-to resource for all things related to upcoming elections. Here, you&rsquo;ll find essential information about candidates, key issues, and voting procedures to help you make informed decisions.\\n\\nJoin us in empowering your community through knowledge and participation. Together, let&rsquo;s make every vote count!\\n\\nPUBLIC RECORDS REQUESTS \\n\\nThe public may submit public records requests for Elections Department records by submitting a request through the Pima County Clerk of the Board&#39;s online request portal. \\n\\n2026 ELECTION AND VOTER INFORMATION"}}}},"options":{"autoPopulate":false,"optionSetId":1,"autoAdjust":true,"removePastDates":true,"hidePlaceholders":false,"skinId":43,"widgetFormat":"STACKED","presetId":"STACKED_PRESET","viewAllRadioOption":"default","selectedSortDisplayName":"Most Relevant","includedAssetTypes":{"images":false,"pdfs":true,"otherFiles":false}},"itemsUnableToRender":[],"formatConfigurations":{},"status":"UNIVERSAL > LOADING","columns":[["ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7"]],"autoPopulatedContentItems":[],"manualContentItemIds":["ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7"],"manualContentItemsOptions":{"ea7dabbc-c3b6-44f9-ad88-56434492bdc7":{"contentType":"article","isAsset":false,"isImage":false,"options":{}}},"filterOptions":{}},"6acb760a-279d-48b2-9996-331cb81ebd2c":{"isInitialized":true,"widgetId":"6acb760a-279d-48b2-9996-331cb81ebd2c","contentItems":{"278faa5f-617a-4724-a2fe-22c45c452cd2":{"contentItemId":"278faa5f-617a-4724-a2fe-22c45c452cd2","isLoading":false,"isPlaceholderItem":false,"contentType":"event","id":"278faa5f-617a-4724-a2fe-22c45c452cd2","slug":"2026-general-election","createdBy":"subject:e03b7a17-09af-4173-b298-4f3a441ab169","lastModifiedBy":"subject:e03b7a17-09af-4173-b298-4f3a441ab169","data":{"title":{"en":"2026 General Election"},"eventdate":{"iv":{"startDate":"2026-11-03T13:00:00Z","endDate":"2026-11-04T02:00:00Z","from":"2026-11-03T13:00:00.000Z","to":"2026-11-04T02:00:00.000Z","multipleDays":false,"allDay":false}},"description":{"en":"<p>Election Day for the 2026 General Election. Vote Centers will be open from 6 a.m. to 7 p.m. Vote Center locations will be available on <a href=\\"http://www.pima.vote\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">pima.vote<\/a>.<\/p>"},"image":{"iv":[]}},"titles":{"title":{"en":"2026 General Election"}},"searchFields":{"eventdate":{"iv":{"startDate":"2026-11-03T13:00:00Z","endDate":"2026-11-04T02:00:00Z","from":"2026-11-03T13:00:00.000Z","to":"2026-11-04T02:00:00.000Z","multipleDays":false,"allDay":false}},"description":{"en":"<p>Election Day for the 2026 General Election. Vote Centers will be open from 6 a.m. to 7 p.m. Vote Center locations will be available on <a href=\\"http://www.pima.vote\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">pima.vote<\/a>.<\/p>"},"image":{"iv":[]}},"created":"2026-07-28T21:26:37Z","lastModified":"2026-07-29T23:48:29Z","status":"UNIVERSAL > LOADING_COMPLETE","statusColor":"#4caf50","contentTypeName":"event","contentTypeDisplayName":"Event","version":5,"contentTypeId":"b8973858-31f8-4b2b-b791-41fb8545a3a5,event","tagsDeleted":[