es from the Elections Department and the Recorder&rsquo;s Office. Find important dates and deadlines, registration information, voting options and more. Explore the <a href=\\"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/21445fb10f884caea0aac1ecba764599/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">interactive map<\/a> to find the most convenient Vote Centers, early voting sites and ballot drop-off locations.<\/p><p>Voters who are unable to leave their vehicles can vote curbside at <a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/b18fecdf-2291-407f-9fbc-9551c7e06719\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\">21 Pima County Vote Centers (PDF)<\/a> on Election Day, Nov. 3.<\/p>"}},"created":"2026-09-18T18:48:05Z","lastModified":"2026-10-15T22:02:43Z","status":"Published","statusColor":"#4caf50","contentTypeName":"article","contentTypeDisplayName":"Article","version":4,"contentTypeId":"b3d073e4-61c9-4ef8-bd47-543a8c94e32f,article","tagsDeleted":[],"tags":["Elections"],"categories":[{"id":"ea233dff-a4bf-4071-ab68-20fdf6e902ea","name":"Elections"}],"permissionSet":{"id":"06f7b6d6-092b-4bee-8b9a-c3e45a10aeda","name":"Article","version":0,"lastModified":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","_links":{}},"notificationDetails":{"subject":"A modification to a Article has been made!","smsMessage":"A modification to a Article has been made!"},"isEncrypted":false,"emailAddresses":[],"_links":{"self":{"href":"/api/content/az-pimacounty/article/33bf660c-46ef-47d2-9cc2-aa2a7d07aff4","method":"GET"},"previous":{"href":"/api/content/az-pimacounty/article/33bf660c-46ef-47d2-9cc2-aa2a7d07aff4/3","method":"GET"}},"contentType":"article","contentItemId":"33bf660c-46ef-47d2-9cc2-aa2a7d07aff4"},"3d87c440-5006-47fb-a6a3-deb68c44a884":{"id":"3d87c440-5006-47fb-a6a3-deb68c44a884","slug":"elections","createdBy":"subject:3baefc86-68aa-466b-a510-801f28f5aeb8","lastModifiedBy":"su