/p><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><br><\/p><ul style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><li><a href=\\"https://pimacaz.precinctcentral.com/TED/ElectionForcePortal/JobApplication.aspx\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Poll Worker Application - Apply today!<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/15249fa5-77ea-4a7a-aade-03954e8b88a5\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"docaccess-activated\\" data-docaccess-source-url=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/15249fa5-77ea-4a7a-aade-03954e8b88a5\\" data-url-hash=\\"7c09550814e47678ef3118c437ce25fadb5b6833c9313c7449943ebbb7508fc7\\" data-url-status=\\"disabled\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Poll Worker Handbook (PDF)<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://pimacaz.precinctcentral.com/TED/ElectionForcePortal/Landing.aspx\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Poll Worker Portal<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"/667/Poll-Worker-Information\\">Poll Worker Qualifications<\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card-bottom\\"><div class=\\"pc-button-standard\\"><a href=\\"/667/Poll-Worker-Information\\"><div class=\\"pc-graphic-button pc-task-worker\\"><span>More Poll Worker Information<\/span><\/div><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-top\\" style=\\"padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-image\\"><a href=\\"/620/Campaign-Finance\\"><img src=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/76c1f3b8-0d4a-486b-860a-6a31ed378045\\" class=\\"fr-fic fr-dii\\" alt=\\"\\"><span>Campaign Finance<\/span><\/a><\/div><hr><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\">Transparency in campaign finance helps you make informed choices. For more details view specific financial reports at the links provided below.<\/p><ul style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><li><a href=\\"http://pimacountyaz.easyvotecampaignfinance.com\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" id=\\"isPasted\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Search Campaign Finance Records<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://www.pima.gov/asset/89bf1f3b-cc98-4c83-93ac-0ecb3638ae42\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2025-2026 Campaign Finance Report (Fillable PDF)<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://www.azleg.gov/arsDetail/?title=16\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Arizona Revised Statutes, Title 16<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://www.pima.gov/620/Campaign-Finance\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\">More information for new and established committees<\/a><\/li><\/ul><div class=\\"pc-card-bottom\\"><div class=\\"pc-button-standard\\"><a href=\\"/620/Campaign-Finance\\"><div class=\\"pc-graphic-button pc-audit\\"><span>More Campaign Finance<\/span><\/div><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>"}},"titles":{"name":{"en":"Elections Cards"}},"searchFields":{"article":{"en":"<div class=\\"pc-container-flex pc-flex-30\\"><div class=\\"pc-card\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-top\\" style=\\"padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-image\\"><a href=\\"/2865/Election-Results\\"><img src=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/ce5cb84e-8be1-4107-9cad-c2e5ed8a0ecf\\" class=\\"fr-fic fr-dii\\" alt=\\"\\"> <span>Results &amp; Data<\/span><\/a><\/div><hr><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\">Statewide voter registration statistics and election results.<strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><br><\/p><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><strong>General Election - Tuesday, November 3, 2026<\/strong><\/p><ul><li style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/6f78d212-b285-45ec-8540-eb6921530b1e\\" target=\\"_bla