ge\\">2026 Primary Election Day Early Ballot Drop-Off Guide (PDF)<\/a><\/li><li data-pasted=\\"true\\"><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/bc32ca8d-ae7c-469f-a612-51ab1a83f14b\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2026 Primary Election After-Action Report (PDF)<\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card-bottom\\"><div class=\\"pc-button-standard\\"><a href=\\"/810/Current-Information\\"><div class=\\"pc-graphic-button pc-info\\"><span>More Election Information<\/span><\/div><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-top\\" style=\\"padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-image\\"><a href=\\"/678/Candidate-PAC-Information-Packets\\"><img src=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/f21d9e81-b81f-4be3-b5e2-d1cda51a8b05\\" class=\\"fr-fic fr-dii\\" alt=\\"\\"> <span>Candidates<\/span><\/a><\/div><hr><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\">Explore candidate filings for federal, state, and local offices.<\/p><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><br><\/p><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\" data-pasted=\\"true\\"><strong>General Election - November 3, 2026<\/strong><\/p><ul><li data-pasted=\\"true\\" style=\\"text-align: left;\\"><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/cff6dae0-1297-4a92-94db-c29661602fff\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"docaccess-activated\\" data-docaccess-source-url=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/cff6dae0-1297-4a92-94db-c29661602fff\\" data-url-hash=\\"8e45ee4eb178a77cc66d4d495cd56127fc62f687e40b2637e3c78e72c233b660\\" data-url-status=\\"new\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2026 Statements of Interest Filed - General (PDF)<\/a><\/li><li data-pasted=\\"true\\" style=\\"text-align: left;\\"><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/4e390a40-4306-4cb1-a524-83006e9f11d4\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2026 General Election Candidates Filed (PDF)<\/a><\/li><li data-pasted=\\"true\\" style=\\"text-align: left;\\"><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/d2c310c3-ade7-484e-a6f0-1ddaebec0799\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2026 General Election Official Candidate List (PDF)<\/a><\/li><li data-pasted=\\"true\\" style=\\"text-align: left;\\"><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/az-pimacounty/b54c9e42-8520-4201-be8d-10b859da80df\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">2026 General Election Official Write-In List (PDF)<\/a><\/li><\/ul><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card-bottom\\"><div class=\\"pc-button-standard\\"><a href=\\"/678/Candidates\\"><div class=\\"pc-graphic-button pc-people\\"><span>More Candidate Information<\/span><\/div><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-top\\" style=\\"padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-image\\"><a href=\\"/667/Poll-Worker-Information\\"><img src=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/b64d4a2a-6806-44b3-a8fb-1bc3212fc957\\" class=\\"fr-fic fr-dii\\" alt=\\"\\"> <span>Get Involved - Be a Poll Worker<\/span><\/a><\/div><hr><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\">Help your community and support democracy on Election Day! Poll workers receive training and a stipend.<\/p><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><br><\/p><ul style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><li><a href=\\"https://pimacaz.precinctcentral.com/TED/ElectionForcePortal/JobApplication.aspx\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Poll Worker Application - Apply today!<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/15249fa5-77ea-4a7a-aade-03954e8b88a5\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" class=\\"docaccess-activated\\" data-docaccess-source-url=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/15249fa5-77ea-4a7a-aade-03954e8b88a5\\" data-url-hash=\\"7c09550814e47678ef3118c437ce25fadb5b6833c9313c7449943ebbb7508fc7\\" data-url-status=\\"disabled\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Poll Worker Handbook (PDF)<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://pimacaz.precinctcentral.com/TED/ElectionForcePortal/Landing.aspx\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Poll Worker Portal<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"/667/Poll-Worker-Information\\">Poll Worker Qualifications<\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card-bottom\\"><div class=\\"pc-button-standard\\"><a href=\\"/667/Poll-Worker-Information\\"><div class=\\"pc-graphic-button pc-task-worker\\"><span>More Poll Worker Information<\/span><\/div><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\\"pc-card\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-top\\" style=\\"padding: 1em 1em 0 1em !important;\\"><div class=\\"pc-card-image\\"><a href=\\"/620/Campaign-Finance\\"><img src=\\"https://content.civicplus.com/api/assets/76c1f3b8-0d4a-486b-860a-6a31ed378045\\" class=\\"fr-fic fr-dii\\" alt=\\"\\"><span>Campaign Finance<\/span><\/a><\/div><hr><p style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\">Transparency in campaign finance helps you make informed choices. For more details view specific financial reports at the links provided below.<\/p><ul style=\\"text-align: left !important;\\"><li><a href=\\"http://pimacountyaz.easyvotecampaignfinance.com\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" id=\\"isPasted\\" aria-describedby=\\"audioeye_new_window_message\\">Search Campaign Finance Records<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\\"https://www.pima.gov/asset/89bf